abstract: >-
  Analysis framework and processed benchmarking outputs for deep
  whole-exome sequencing of the Genome in a Bottle reference sample
  NA12878 (HG001), generated from a single aliquoted genomic DNA stock
  and sequenced in parallel on Illumina NovaSeq 6000, BGI DNBSEQ-T7 and
  GeneMind SURFSeq 5000. Contains the deterministic pipeline that
  produced 450 benchmarking runs spanning an 18-point on-target depth
  titration, two callers (GATK4 HaplotypeCaller and DeepVariant) on CPU
  and GPU (NVIDIA Parabricks), and two reference builds (GRCh38 and
  GRCh37/b37), each evaluated against the GIAB HG001 v4.2.1 benchmark
  with hap.py; together with the aggregated results table, per-run
  coverage and timing tables, CPU-versus-GPU site-level concordance and
  quality tables, sample identity and contamination QC, the capture
  target BED in both builds, and per-figure source data and plotting
  code.
